# PlugKit

> One API to publish, read, and reply across Instagram, WhatsApp & more — built for AI agents.

- [PlugKit](https://docs.plugkit.co/index.md): One API to publish, read, and reply across every social platform — built for developers and AI agents.
- [Quickstart](https://docs.plugkit.co/quickstart.md): From zero to your first published post.
- [Authentication](https://docs.plugkit.co/authentication.md): How PlugKit authenticates the dashboard and your code.
- [Profiles & accounts](https://docs.plugkit.co/concepts/profiles-and-accounts.md): The data model behind every PlugKit request.
- [How analytics are collected](https://docs.plugkit.co/concepts/analytics-collection.md): Cadences, freshness, history depth, and what each platform actually exposes.
- [Plans & billing](https://docs.plugkit.co/concepts/billing.md): What a plan includes, what extra accounts cost, and how per-call platforms are re-billed.
- [MCP server](https://docs.plugkit.co/mcp/overview.md): Give Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, VS Code or any MCP client the ability to publish, read and reply on your social accounts.
- [Connect a client](https://docs.plugkit.co/mcp/clients.md): Add the PlugKit MCP server to Claude, ChatGPT, Claude Code, Cursor, VS Code, or any other MCP client.
- [Tools & workflows](https://docs.plugkit.co/mcp/tools.md): The 103 tools and 3 ready-made workflows exposed by the PlugKit MCP server.
- [Instagram](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/instagram.md): Publish, DM, moderate comments and read insights on Instagram business accounts.
- [Facebook](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/facebook.md): Publish to a Page, answer Messenger, moderate comments and read insights.
- [TikTok](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/tiktok.md): Publish videos to TikTok via the official Login Kit + Content Posting API.
- [YouTube](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/youtube.md): Upload videos to YouTube via the Google Data API.
- [X (Twitter)](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/x.md): Post tweets with media and read account & tweet analytics.
- [WhatsApp](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/whatsapp.md): Connect a customer's own WhatsApp number and hold two-way conversations.
- [Telegram](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/telegram.md): Post to channels and receive messages with a Telegram bot.
- [Meta Ads](https://docs.plugkit.co/platforms/meta-ads.md): Run Facebook and Instagram campaigns — campaigns, ad sets, ads, boosts and insights.
- [Publishing](https://docs.plugkit.co/guides/publishing.md): Publish one post to several platforms, now or later.
- [Messaging](https://docs.plugkit.co/guides/messaging.md): One inbox across Instagram, Facebook, WhatsApp and Telegram.
- [Engagement](https://docs.plugkit.co/guides/engagement.md): Comments, replies and mentions across Instagram, Facebook Pages and Threads.
- [Campaigns](https://docs.plugkit.co/guides/campaigns.md): Turn comments into DMs, broadcast to your inbox, and follow up on a schedule.
- [Analytics](https://docs.plugkit.co/guides/analytics.md): Cross-platform metrics for every post you publish — and every post you didn't.
- [Webhooks](https://docs.plugkit.co/guides/webhooks.md): Get told when a post goes live, a message arrives, or an account drops.
