- [Product tagging status of an Instagram account](https://docs.plugkit.co/api-reference/shopping/product-tagging-status-of-an-instagram-account.md): Says whether products can be tagged, and when not, exactly what is missing: no authorization yet, an expired one, a shop Meta has not approved, or a shop with no catalog. Meta is re-checked at most every 6 hours unless `refresh=true`.
- [Get the Facebook authorization URL that enables product tagging](https://docs.plugkit.co/api-reference/shopping/get-the-facebook-authorization-url-that-enables-product-tagging.md): Product tagging lives on a different Meta API than the Instagram connection PlugKit already holds, so it needs its own authorization. Open the returned URL in a browser and pick the Facebook Page linked to this Instagram account.
