- [Tag products on a published Instagram post or reel](https://docs.plugkit.co/api-reference/shopping/tag-products-on-a-published-instagram-post-or-reel.md): Replaces the product tags of an existing media. Up to 20 tags on a photo (each with x/y coordinates between 0 and 1) and 30 on a video or reel, where coordinates do not apply. Instagram allows 25 tagged posts per 24 hours per account.
